{"license":"CC-BY-4.0","fileAccessRequest":false,"metadataBlocks":{"citation":{"displayName":"Citation Metadata","name":"citation","fields":[{"typeName":"title","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Getuigen Verhalen, Vier verzetsvrouwen: Gewoon Doen en Fier Rechtopstaan, interview 05"},{"typeName":"otherId","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"otherIdAgency":{"typeName":"otherIdAgency","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"DANS-KNAW"},"otherIdValue":{"typeName":"otherIdValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"easy-dataset:41257"}}]},{"typeName":"author","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"authorName":{"typeName":"authorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Cultuur & Co."}}]},{"typeName":"datasetContact","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"datasetContactName":{"typeName":"datasetContactName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"a.j  stam"},"datasetContactAffiliation":{"typeName":"datasetContactAffiliation","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"cultuur & co"}}]},{"typeName":"dsDescription","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"dsDescriptionValue":{"typeName":"dsDescriptionValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"<p>Evert van der Molen (geboren 1917) is de oudste broer van Geert van der Molen, geinterviewde 4 in dit project. Evert volgde een opleiding als onderwijzer. In de jaren dertig kon hij als kwekeling met acte geen betaald werk in Nederland vinden. Wel kon hij in 1939 werk vinden aan een MULO school in Medan, zodat hij als jonge onderwijzer afreisde naar toenmalig Nederlands-Indië, het huidige Indonesië. In Nederlands-Indië moest hij ook beschikbaar zijn voor militaire dienst. Zijn verloofde was actief in het verzet in Nederland.<\/p><p>Evert werd krijgsgevangene gemaakt door de Japanners en werd gedwongen te werken aan de Birma-spoorlijn. Daarna moest hij  nog anderhalf jaar in Japan in een kolenmijn werken. Hij heeft de verwoestingen in Nagasaki gezien.<\/p><p>Terug in Indonesië kwam hij als ex-krijgsgevangene op Borneo terecht, en werd daar opnieuw onderwijzer aan de MULO. Zijn verloofde kwam in 1947 over.<br><br>Zijn zuster Geert koos voor communisme. Volgens Evert hadden haar ervaringen als schipperskind daarmee te maken. Evert kwam in Indonesië in contact met iemand van de Pinkstergemeente en vond daar zijn religieuze onderdak.<\/p>"}},{"dsDescriptionValue":{"typeName":"dsDescriptionValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Date Submitted: 2010-03-26"}}]},{"typeName":"subject","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["Arts and Humanities"]},{"typeName":"keyword","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Schipperskind"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"onderwijs"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"MULO"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Nederlands-Indië"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"de oudste broer van verzetsvrouw Geert van der Molen"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"West Java"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Sukabumi"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Ambon"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"krijgsgevangene"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Birma spoorlijn"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"honger"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"sterfte"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"kolenmijn in Zuid-Japan Fukuoka"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Nagasaki"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Okinawa"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Manilla"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"militaire dienst"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"wachtmeester in KNIL"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Pinkstergemeente"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"trouwen met de handschoen"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Wiesel"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Indonesië"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Oral history"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Tweede Wereldoorlog"}}]},{"typeName":"notesText","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Er is een minimale edit gedaan door PEPfilm, Pepijn Kortbeek in Amsterdam. \n\nBertien Minco (interviewer)  Cultuur & Co.\nDineke Stam (filmcamera en interviewer) Cultuur & Co."},{"typeName":"language","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["Dutch","Western Frisian"]},{"typeName":"productionDate","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"2009-06-12"},{"typeName":"contributor","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"contributorName":{"typeName":"contributorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"B. Minco (Cultuur & Co.)"}},{"contributorName":{"typeName":"contributorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"A.J. Stam (Cultuur & Co.)"}},{"contributorName":{"typeName":"contributorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"P. Kortbeek (PEPfilm)"}}]},{"typeName":"distributionDate","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"2009-12-03"},{"typeName":"dateOfDeposit","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"2009-06-12"},{"typeName":"dataSources","multiple":true,"typeClass":"primitive","value":["Evert schreef een uitgebreid verslag in 1945 om de familie thuis te vertellen over zijn ervaringen. De ruim 200 documenten zijn bij hem in bewaring. Zijn schoondochter Korrie Korevaart uit Leiden heeft het manuscript uitgetypt."]}]},"dansRights":{"displayName":"Rights Metadata","name":"dansRights","fields":[{"typeName":"dansRightsHolder","multiple":true,"typeClass":"primitive","value":["Dineke Stam","Bertien Minco"]},{"typeName":"dansPersonalDataPresent","multiple":false,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":"Unknown"},{"typeName":"dansMetadataLanguage","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["Dutch"]}]},"dansRelationMetadata":{"displayName":"Relation Metadata","name":"dansRelationMetadata","fields":[{"typeName":"dansAudience","multiple":true,"typeClass":"primitive","value":["https:\/\/www.narcis.nl\/classification\/D34300"],"expandedvalue":[{"@id":"https:\/\/www.narcis.nl\/classification\/D34300","termName":[{"lang":"nl","value":"Moderne en contemporaine geschiedenis"},{"lang":"en","value":"Modern and contemporary history"}],"vocabularyUri":"https:\/\/www.narcis.nl\/classification\/"}]},{"typeName":"dansCollection","multiple":true,"typeClass":"primitive","value":["https:\/\/vocabularies.dans.knaw.nl\/collections\/ssh\/ce21b6fb-4283-4194-9369-b3ff4c3d76e7","https:\/\/vocabularies.dans.knaw.nl\/collections\/ssh\/93363926-5d61-4421-976b-a92b471cfb92","https:\/\/voca